     "text": "SOTA Memory Technologies\n\nMemory Extension: LPDDR\n\n\n\n\n\n▪ Hopper retains local HBM. Grace connects LPDDR5X through the coherent\n  NVLink-C2C CPU–GPU link.\n▪ LPDDR extends the capacity the accelerator can address; it does not enlarge\n HBM itself.\n\nMemory Wall     CPU Memory     GPU Memory    SOTA Memory     Advanced AI Computing and Systems        68",
