     "page": 69,
     "text": "SOTA Memory Technologies\n\nTiered Memory Management Decides What Stays in HBM\n\n\n\n\n\n▪ Keep hot, latency-critical, frequently reused data in HBM. Place large, cold objects\n  in the LPDDR capacity tier.\n▪ Promotion helps only when future reuse saves more than the transfer and\n  bookkeeping cost.\n\nMemory Wall     CPU Memory     GPU Memory    SOTA Memory     Advanced AI Computing and Systems        69",
